hdl:21.11165\/4cat\/6mxw-xsrd dcterms:creator _:c14n23 ;
	dcterms:description "Data from Weber et al., ACS Catal. 2025, 15, 18857: DFT and machine-learned-potential (EquiformerV2/OCP, MACE-MPA-0) binding energies of OH and CO used to screen active phases; nominal and XRF compositions of 76 co-precipitated Cu-Ga-Al hydrotalcite-like precursors; the 13 compositions of the initial activity screening; calcination temperatures of the seven optimized catalysts; and the 17-condition test protocol for CO2/CO hydrogenation to methanol and dimethyl ether at 80 bar in a 16-fold fixed-bed reactor. Catalytic results (conversions, yields) and further characterization (PXRD, N2 sorption, TPR, N2O-RFC, TEM) are reported in the article but not deposited." ;
	dcterms:isReferencedBy doi:10.1021\/acscatal.5c03876 ;
	dcterms:publisher _:c14n49 ;
	dcterms:subject coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_all , coremeta4cat:REAC_6mxw-xsrd_CO2_hydrogenation , coremeta4cat:REAC_6mxw-xsrd_screening ;
	dcterms:title "Copper Gallium Aluminum Mixed Metal Oxides as Alternative Catalyst Candidates for Efficient Conversion of Carbon Dioxide to Methanol and Dimethyl Ether" , "Repository landing page" ;
	a rdfs:Resource , dcat:Dataset , voc4cat:0007001 ;
