coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_all dcterms:description "76 HTC precursors characterized by XRF; 13 screening catalysts and 7 optimized catalysts tested; 17 doped oxide sites (DFT) and 37 intermetallic and elemental compositions (machine-learned potentials). See was_generated_by and is_about_activity for detail." ;
	dcterms:title "Cu-Ga-Al mixed metal oxides and computational surface models" ;
	a prov:Entity .
coremeta4cat:CHAR_6mxw-xsrd_XRF dcterms:description "X-ray fluorescence analysis of 76 Cu-Ga-Al compositions spanning the Cu/Al/Ga ternary (Cu 0-1, Al 0-1, Ga 0-1, metal fractions normalised to 1), including the three single-metal end members. According to the article (section 3.2), XRF was measured on the freeze-dried hydrotalcite-like (HTC) precursors, i.e. before calcination. Measured Cu, Al and Ga fractions are reported next to the nominal fractions." ;
	dcterms:title "XRF elemental analysis (76 Cu-Ga-Al hydrotalcite-like precursors)" ;
	a "Characterization" , voc4cat:0000067 ;
	adms:identifier _:c14n27 ;
	prov:used coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_HTC_library , coremeta4cat:CHAR_6mxw-xsrd_XRF_method ;
	prov:wasAssociatedWith coremeta4cat:DEV_6mxw-xsrd_XRF .
coremeta4cat:CHAR_6mxw-xsrd_XRF_method dcterms:description "Elemental composition by the fundamental parameter method in ESPRIT; metal fractions of Cu, Al and Ga normalised to their sum. Sample preparation and measurement conditions are not stated in the main text of the article." ;
	dcterms:title "XRF determination of Cu, Al and Ga metal fractions" ;
	a OBI:0000272 .
