	RXNO:0000425 coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G1_500 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G1_600 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G1_700 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G2_450_250 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G2_450_350 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G2_550_250 , coremeta4cat:CAT_6mxw-xsrd_G2_550_350 ;
	dcterms:description "Gas-phase testing of the first-generation (Cu0.465Ga0.07Al0.465, calcined at 500, 600 and 700 C) and second-generation (Cu0.85Al0.15 with 1 wt% Ga, two calcination steps) catalysts under all 17 conditions of the test protocol: 80 bar, 225-300 C, GHSV 3000 and 6000 h-1, CO2 13-27.1 vol%, CO 0-15.8 vol%, H2 36.7-76 vol%, 5 vol% Ar, balance N2 (0-26.7 vol%), H2/COx 1.2-4. Pretreatment: 2 h at 300 C and 20 bar under 10 vol% Ar in N2 (GHSV 6000 h-1, 48 L/h), then in-situ reduction in the syngas feed. Products are methanol and dimethyl ether, with methane as a minor by-product. Conversions and yields are reported in the article's figures only; they are not deposited." ;
	dcterms:title "CO2/CO hydrogenation over optimized Cu-Ga-Al mixed metal oxides (17 conditions, 7 catalysts)" ;
