coremeta4cat:SIM_6mxw-xsrd_DFT_active_sites dcterms:description "Density functional theory binding energies of OH and CO at 17 sites: pristine CuGa2O4 and CuGa2O4 doped with Al, Co, Cu, Ge, In, Ni or Sn, and pristine Ga2O3 and Ga2O3 doped with Al, Pd, Pt, Rh, Ru, Sn, Zn or Zr. Site notation in the source file is <host>-<dopant>, e.g. CuGa2O4-Co. Part of the theory-based prediction that led to the Cu-Ga-Al system (article, section 3.1)." ;
	dcterms:title "DFT binding energies of OH and CO at 17 oxide surface sites" ;
	a "Simulation" , voc4cat:0000215 ;
	adms:identifier _:c14n35 ;
	prov:used coremeta4cat:SIM_6mxw-xsrd_DFT_method , coremeta4cat:SLAB_6mxw-xsrd_CuGa2O4_sites , coremeta4cat:SLAB_6mxw-xsrd_Ga2O3_sites ;
	coremeta4cat:calculated_property _:c14n13 , _:c14n18 ;
	coremeta4cat:software_package "Atomic Simulation Environment (ASE), structure generation" , "VASP" , "pymatgen, structure generation" .
coremeta4cat:SIM_6mxw-xsrd_DFT_method dcterms:description "Vienna Ab initio Simulation Package with the PBE functional and projector augmented waves. The article uses PBE-D3 when verifying the machine-learned potentials; whether D3 was applied for this table is not stated in the main text. Cut-off, k-points and convergence criteria are in the SI." ;
	dcterms:title "periodic DFT, PBE, PAW" ;
	a coremeta4cat:DFT ;
	coremeta4cat:exchange_correlation_functional "PBE" .
coremeta4cat:SIM_6mxw-xsrd_MLIP_MACE dcterms:description "Binding energies of OH and CO computed with the MACE-MPA-0 machine-learned interatomic potential for 31 elemental and intermetallic compositions, as a second model next to the OCP screening; both serve as prescreening and sampling for DFT calculations, with DFT verification at the PBE-D3 level (Weber et al., ACS Catal. 2025, Table 2 and section 3.1). Surface facets, adsorption sites and the reference states of the binding energies are in the article's SI, not in the main text." ;
	dcterms:title "MACE-MPA-0 binding-energy screening of OH and CO (31 compositions)" ;
	a "Simulation" ;
